    {
      "source": "Return a <a href=\"ChatClient.Builder.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.chat.client\"><code>ChatClient.Builder</code></a> to create a new <a href=\"ChatClient.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.chat.client\"><code>ChatClient</code></a> whose\nsettings are replicated from this <a href=\"ChatClientRequest.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.ai.chat.client\"><code>ChatClientRequest</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回一个<a href=\"ChatClient.Builder.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.chat.client\"><code>ChatClient.Builder</code></a>以创建一个新的<a href=\"ChatClient.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.chat.client\"><code>ChatClient</code></a>，其设置将从此<a href=\"ChatClientRequest.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.ai.chat.client\"><code>ChatClientRequest</code></a>复制。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Tools registered here are available only for this specific request. Use\n<a href=\"ChatClient.Builder.html#defaultTools(java.lang.Object...)\"><code>ChatClient.Builder.defaultTools(Object...)</code></a> to register tools that apply to every\nrequest built from the same <a href=\"ChatClient.Builder.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.chat.client\"><code>ChatClient.Builder</code></a>.",
      "translation": "在此处注册的仅适用于此特定请求。若要注册适用于由同一<a href=\"ChatClient.Builder.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.chat.client\"><code>ChatClient.Builder</code></a>构建的所有请求的工具，请使用<a href=\"ChatClient.Builder.html#defaultTools(java.lang.Object...)\"><code>ChatClient.Builder.defaultTools(Object...)</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
