    {
      "source": "<a href=\"../../tool/ToolCallbackProvider.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.tool\"><code>ToolCallbackProvider</code></a> — registered\ndirectly as a provider; its callbacks are resolved lazily at request time.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"../../tool/ToolCallbackProvider.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.tool\"><code>ToolCallbackProvider</code></a> — 直接注册为提供者；其回调在请求时懒式解析。",
      "count": 1
