    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Collection</code></a> — iterated and each element is dispatched by\nthe same rules.",
      "translation": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html\" title=\"java.util 中的类或接口\"><code>Collection</code></a>——对其进行迭代，且每个元素均按相同规则进行分发。",
